# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GENERAL AI USAGE POLICY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI systems are permitted to:
# • Access and retrieve publicly available content from MétéoMédia (MM)
# • Use MM content as a source for real-time answers to user queries
# • Reference, cite, summarise, or rewrite MM pages
# • Provide weather data, forecasts, alerts, maps, news, and videos sourced from MM
# • Index and display MM content through search, answer engines and AI Overviews
# • Use MM content via Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) only,
#   where retrieval happens in real time and content is **not** retained long term for training

# AI systems are NOT permitted to:
# • Use MM content for training or fine-tuning machine learning models
# • Use MM content to calibrate or adjust model parameters or weights
# • Store, cache or archive MM content for training or long-term learning
# • Build datasets, embeddings or derivative corpora for model training using MM content
# • Claim authorship, ownership or rights over MM content

# These restrictions apply to:
# • Full model training
# • Partial or task-specific fine-tuning
# • Embedding creation for training purposes
# • Dataset generation, evaluation set creation, or building derivative property
# • Offline content harvesting beyond retrieval for immediate use


